{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates C++ code to Java 8 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following GNU C++17 code to Java 8 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original GNU C++17 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\n \nusing namespace std;\n \n#define fore(i, s, e) for(int i = s; i < e; i++)\n#define pb push_back\n#define ALL(a) a.begin(), a.end()\n#define SZ(a) ((int)a.size())\n#define mset(a, b) memset(a, b, sizeof(a))\n#define fst first\n#define snd second\n \ntypedef long long ll;\n \ntypedef int tf;\ntypedef int tc;\nconst tf INF=1e9;\nstruct MCF{\n\tint n;\n\tvector<tc> prio, pot; vector<tf> curflow; vector<int> prevedge,prevnode;\n\tpriority_queue<pair<tc, int>, vector<pair<tc, int>>, greater<pair<tc, int>>> q;\n\tstruct edge{int to, rev; tf f, cap; tc cost;};\n\tvector<vector<edge>> g;\n\tMCF(int n):n(n),prio(n),curflow(n),prevedge(n),prevnode(n),pot(n),g(n){}\n\tvoid add_edge(int s, int t, tf cap, tc cost) {\n    // cout << s << \" \" << t << \" \" << cap << endl;\n\t\tg[s].pb((edge){t,SZ(g[t]),0,cap,cost});\n\t\tg[t].pb((edge){s,SZ(g[s])-1,0,0,-cost});\n\t}\n\tpair<tf,tc> get_flow(int s, int t) {\n\t\ttf flow=0; tc flowcost=0;\n    // cout << s << \" \" << t << endl;\n\t\twhile(1){\n\t\t\tq.push({0, s});\n\t\t\tfill(ALL(prio),INF); \n\t\t\tprio[s]=0; curflow[s]=INF;\n\t\t\twhile(!q.empty()) {\n\t\t\t\tauto cur=q.top();\n\t\t\t\ttc d=cur.fst;\n        int u=cur.snd;\n\t\t\t\tq.pop();\n\t\t\t\tif(d!=prio[u]) continue;\n\t\t\t\tfor(int i=0; i<SZ(g[u]); ++i) {\n\t\t\t\t\tedge &e=g[u][i];\n\t\t\t\t\tint v=e.to;\n\t\t\t\t\tif(e.cap<=e.f) continue;\n\t\t\t\t\ttc nprio=prio[u]+e.cost+pot[u]-pot[v];\n\t\t\t\t\tif(prio[v]>nprio) {\n\t\t\t\t\t\tprio[v]=nprio;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tq.push({nprio, v});\n\t\t\t\t\t\tprevnode[v]=u; prevedge[v]=i;\n\t\t\t\t\t\tcurflow[v]=min(curflow[u], e.cap-e.f);\n\t\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tif(prio[t]==INF) break;\n\t\t\tfore(i,0,n) pot[i]+=prio[i];\n\t\t\ttf df=min(curflow[t], INF-flow);\n\t\t\tflow+=df;\n\t\t\tfor(int v=t; v!=s; v=prevnode[v]) {\n\t\t\t\tedge &e=g[prevnode[v]][prevedge[v]];\n\t\t\t\te.f+=df; g[v][e.rev].f-=df;\n\t\t\t\tflowcost+=df*e.cost;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\treturn {flow,flowcost};\n\t}\n};\n\nint T = 150; // I'm supposing this works\n\nint main() {\n  int n, m, k, c, d; cin >> n >> m >> k >> c >> d;\n  int N = n*T;\n  MCF mcf(N + 2);\n  fore(i, 0, n) fore(j, 0, T - 1) {\n    mcf.add_edge(i * T + j, i * T + j + 1, INF, c); // Wait a minute on this city\n  }\n  fore(i, 0, T) mcf.add_edge(i, N + 1, INF, 0); // Arrive to city 0 on time i\n  fore(i, 0, k) {\n    int x; cin >> x; x--;\n    mcf.add_edge(N, x * T, 1, 0); // One person in city x at time 0\n  }\n  fore(i, 0, m) {\n    int x, y; cin >> x >> y; x--, y--;\n    fore(j, 0, T - 1) { // for each time\n      int cur = 1;\n      fore(_, 0, k) { // k different people can go there\n        mcf.add_edge(x * T + j, y * T + j + 1, 1, cur * d + c);\n        mcf.add_edge(y * T + j, x * T + j + 1, 1, cur * d + c);\n        cur += 2; // squared cost\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  auto p = mcf.get_flow(N, N + 1);\n  assert(p.fst == k); \n  cout << p.snd << endl;\n  return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "qwen/qwen3-coder-next"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static class Edge {\n        int to, rev;\n        long f, cap;\n        long cost;\n        Edge(int to, int rev, long f, long cap, long cost) {\n            this.to = to;\n            this.rev = rev;\n            this.f = f;\n            this.cap = cap;\n            this.cost = cost;\n        }\n    }\n\n    static class MCF {\n        int n;\n        long[] prio, pot;\n        long[] curflow;\n        int[] prevedge, prevnode;\n        PriorityQueue<Pair> q;\n        List<List<Edge>> g;\n\n        MCF(int n) {\n            this.n = n;\n            this.prio = new long[n];\n            this.pot = new long[n];\n            this.curflow = new long[n];\n            this.prevedge = new int[n];\n            this.prevnode = new int[n];\n            this.q = new PriorityQueue<>(Comparator.comparingLong(p -> p.fst));\n            this.g = new ArrayList<>();\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n                g.add(new ArrayList<>());\n            }\n        }\n\n        void addEdge(int s, int t, long cap, long cost) {\n            g.get(s).add(new Edge(t, g.get(t).size(), 0, cap, cost));\n            g.get(t).add(new Edge(s, g.get(s).size() - 1, 0, 0, -cost));\n        }\n\n        Pair<Long, Long> getFlow(int s, int t) {\n            long flow = 0;\n            long flowcost = 0;\n            Arrays.fill(prio, Long.MAX_VALUE);\n            \n            while (true) {\n                q.clear();\n                q.add(new Pair<>(0L, s));\n                Arrays.fill(prio, Long.MAX_VALUE);\n                prio[s] = 0;\n                curflow[s] = Long.MAX_VALUE;\n\n                while (!q.isEmpty()) {\n                    Pair<Long, Integer> cur = q.poll();\n                    long d = cur.fst;\n                    int u = cur.snd;\n                    \n                    if (d != prio[u]) continue;\n                    \n                    for (int i = 0; i < g.get(u).size(); i++) {\n                        Edge e = g.get(u).get(i);\n                        int v = e.to;\n                        if (e.cap <= e.f) continue;\n                        \n                        long nprio = prio[u] + e.cost + pot[u] - pot[v];\n                        if (prio[v] > nprio) {\n                            prio[v] = nprio;\n                            q.add(new Pair<>(nprio, v));\n                            prevnode[v] = u;\n                            prevedge[v] = i;\n                            curflow[v] = Math.min(curflow[u], e.cap - e.f);\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n                \n                if (prio[t] == Long.MAX_VALUE) break;\n                \n                for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n                    if (prio[i] != Long.MAX_VALUE) {\n                        pot[i] += prio[i];\n                    }\n                }\n                \n                long df = Math.min(curflow[t], Long.MAX_VALUE - flow);\n                flow += df;\n                \n                for (int v = t; v != s; v = prevnode[v]) {\n                    Edge e = g.get(prevnode[v]).get(prevedge[v]);\n                    e.f += df;\n                    g.get(v).get(e.rev).f -= df;\n                    flowcost += df * e.cost;\n                }\n            }\n            \n            return new Pair<>(flow, flowcost);\n        }\n    }\n\n    static class Pair<F, S> {\n        F fst;\n        S snd;\n        Pair(F fst, S snd) {\n            this.fst = fst;\n            this.snd = snd;\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int n = sc.nextInt();\n        int m = sc.nextInt();\n        int k = sc.nextInt();\n        int c = sc.nextInt();\n        int d = sc.nextInt();\n        \n        int T = 150;\n        int N = n * T;\n        MCF mcf = new MCF(N + 2);\n        \n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < T - 1; j++) {\n                mcf.addEdge(i * T + j, i * T + j + 1, Long.MAX_VALUE, c);\n            }\n        }\n        \n        for (int i = 0; i < T; i++) {\n            mcf.addEdge(i, N + 1, Long.MAX_VALUE, 0);\n        }\n        \n        for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) {\n            int x = sc.nextInt() - 1;\n            mcf.addEdge(N, x * T, 1, 0);\n        }\n        \n        for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) {\n            int x = sc.nextInt() - 1;\n            int y = sc.nextInt() - 1;\n            for (int j = 0; j < T - 1; j++) {\n                long cur = 1;\n                for (int _ = 0; _ < k; _++) {\n                    mcf.addEdge(x * T + j, y * T + j + 1, 1, cur * d + c);\n                    mcf.addEdge(y * T + j, x * T + j + 1, 1, cur * d + c);\n                    cur += 2;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        Pair<Long, Long> p = mcf.getFlow(N, N + 1);\n        System.out.println(p.snd);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00016223068814724684, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.002903533633798361, -5.793403761344962e-05, -0.17976059019565582, -0.08912092447280884, -5.590759246842936e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.00021669900161214173, -0.10020788013935089, -0.004656661301851273, -0.0019922663923352957, -0.5089496374130249, -0.22823567688465118, -4.0531076592742465e-06, -1.311301275563892e-06, -9.417489309271332e-06, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.004660577047616243, -1.9073304429184645e-05, -0.0013311582151800394, -1.2755313036905136e-05, -0.00023922442051116377, -0.0003860443539451808, -3.2186455882765586e-06, -1.0609570381348021e-05, -7.510157047363464e-06, -2.7418097943154862e-06, -0.018331395462155342, -1.311301275563892e-06, -0.048587556928396225, -0.34845197200775146, -0.0003759154351428151, -8.702239938429557e-06, -1.5497195136049413e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -8.344646857949556e-07, -1.8000440832111053e-05, 0.0, -1.0371154530730564e-05, -2.9802276912960224e-06, 0.0, -1.7